<th id="S5.T1.2.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_r">   + HEPO</th>
<td id="S5.T1.2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">81.7</td>
